==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|wonen|wonēn|lang=goh}}, from {{proto|Germanic|wunanan||wunēnan||wunajanan|to love, wish|lang=de}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|wenə-|to wish, love|lang=de}}. Compare {{etyl|osx|-}} {{term|wunon|lang=osx}} ({{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|wonen|lang=nl}}), {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|wunian|lang=ang}} ({{etyl|en|-}} {{term|wone}}).

